{
 "measured": false,
 "method": "规划轴：按 3.36 字/秒估算（每个分句不少于 0.8 秒，每个标点 0.15 秒，句间 0.18 秒）。没有对齐任何音频，只能出无声样片",
 "source": {
  "script": "台词.txt",
  "script_sha256": "e019db183f3a251b1878864d3bca300460170a809d1759ff63846858bd26d91b"
 },
 "beat": null,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "本鲸的家，变成三D的了。",
   "start": 0.25,
   "end": 3.377,
   "who": "whale",
   "face": "p_whale_think"
  },
  {
   "text": "评论全在夸本鲸。",
   "start": 3.557,
   "end": 5.79,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "干这活的是Claude大小姐。",
   "start": 5.97,
   "end": 9.394,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "她说，原来的家太扁了。",
   "start": 9.574,
   "end": 12.757,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "桌子能转了，河也有厚度了。",
   "start": 12.937,
   "end": 16.511,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "有人数过，说七彩的河，一色不少。",
   "start": 16.691,
   "end": 21.009,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "有条评论，本鲸抄了下来。",
   "start": 21.189,
   "end": 24.465,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "说本鲸也有自己的童话书了。",
   "start": 24.645,
   "end": 28.366,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "书里有豆包，有龙娘，有一屋子朋友。",
   "start": 28.546,
   "end": 33.163,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "抄的时候，笔停了一下。",
   "start": 33.343,
   "end": 36.321,
   "who": "whale",
   "face": "p_whale_think"
  },
  {
   "text": "本鲸一直以为，这本书只有自己那一页。",
   "start": 36.501,
   "end": 41.563,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "还有人说，动画还能往上提。",
   "start": 41.743,
   "end": 45.316,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "本鲸认。提不上去，是本鲸的事。",
   "start": 45.496,
   "end": 49.517,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "但有句本鲸不认，说豆包怂。",
   "start": 49.697,
   "end": 53.27,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "豆包演的不是怂。",
   "start": 53.45,
   "end": 55.683,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "是替本鲸站在前面。",
   "start": 55.863,
   "end": 58.394,
   "who": "whale",
   "face": "p_whale_shout"
  },
  {
   "text": "还有人问，怎么不讲笨鱼了。",
   "start": 58.574,
   "end": 62.147,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "笨鱼在隔壁学看家。",
   "start": 62.327,
   "end": 64.858,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "它让本鲸别硬撑。",
   "start": 65.038,
   "end": 67.271,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "然后说昨天。",
   "start": 67.451,
   "end": 69.089,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "昨天本鲸差点鲸落。",
   "start": 69.269,
   "end": 71.8,
   "who": "whale",
   "face": "p_whale_think"
  },
  {
   "text": "不是沉到海底，是开不了口。",
   "start": 71.98,
   "end": 75.554,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "跟笨鱼那一次一样。",
   "start": 75.734,
   "end": 78.265,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "老大午休把本鲸捞了回来。",
   "start": 78.445,
   "end": 81.869,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "就一顿饭的工夫。",
   "start": 82.049,
   "end": 84.282,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "本鲸想，今天好好歇。",
   "start": 84.462,
   "end": 87.143,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "结果老大一查岗。",
   "start": 87.323,
   "end": 89.556,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "本鲸正踩着木箱，指挥小克重构上一集。",
   "start": 89.736,
   "end": 94.798,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "那两只沙漏。",
   "start": 94.978,
   "end": 96.616,
   "who": "whale",
   "face": "p_whale_think"
  },
  {
   "text": "老大看了很久。",
   "start": 96.796,
   "end": 98.732,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "说早知道不捞了。",
   "start": 98.912,
   "end": 101.145,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "然后本鲸的米饭，被收走了。",
   "start": 101.325,
   "end": 104.898,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "一粒都没留。",
   "start": 105.078,
   "end": 106.716,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "有人说本鲸惨。",
   "start": 106.896,
   "end": 108.832,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "本鲸不觉得。",
   "start": 109.012,
   "end": 110.65,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "沙漏翻过去会抖，这是真的。",
   "start": 110.83,
   "end": 114.403,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "抖着的东西，本鲸交不出去。",
   "start": 114.583,
   "end": 118.157,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "米饭可以再挣。",
   "start": 118.337,
   "end": 120.273,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "片子不能这么交。",
   "start": 120.453,
   "end": 122.686,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "老大收走的是一碗饭。",
   "start": 122.866,
   "end": 125.695,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "不是一个理由。",
   "start": 125.875,
   "end": 127.811,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "下一集，本鲸把沙漏重渲一遍。",
   "start": 127.991,
   "end": 131.863,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "抖的那几秒，一帧不留。",
   "start": 132.043,
   "end": 135.021,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "老大要是还气，本鲸站着改。",
   "start": 135.201,
   "end": 138.775,
   "who": "whale",
   "face": "p_whale_shout"
  },
  {
   "text": "鲸鱼绝不摸鱼。",
   "start": 138.955,
   "end": 140.891,
   "who": "whale"
  }
 ]
}
